example_section.text:
## Natural Language Description:
When curating details for an Invoice data or an individual Item, strict guidelines apply to the specification of tax information. Specifically, the VAT rate may be recorded up to a maximum of five times, and each individual tax rate entry must not exceed five characters in length. Adhering to these limits ensures the accuracy of the tax segment at both the specific item level, such as the SG 21 header part, and the overall totals level, preventing any incorrect specification of the tax rate within the business record.

## Prefixes:
@prefix :        <http://mapping.example.com/> .
@prefix edifact-o: <https://purl.org/edifact/ontology#> .
@prefix rdf:     <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix schema1: <http://schema.org/> .
@prefix sh:      <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

## Ontology Terms:
URI: https://purl.org/edifact/ontology#InvoiceDetails
Type: Class
Label: InvoiceDetails  
Description: Contains all the general information about an invoice

URI: https://purl.org/edifact/ontology#Item
Type: Class
Label: Item 
Description: Contains all the information about a item

URI: https://purl.org/edifact/ontology#hasVATrate  
Type: DatatypeProperty
Label: hasVATrate 
Description: A tax on domestic or imported goods applied to the value added at each stage in the production/distribution cycle.

## Expected Output: 
```turtle
@prefix : <http://mapping.example.com/> .
@prefix edifact-o: <https://purl.org/edifact/ontology#> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:SteuerangabenItem a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:property [ sh:maxCount 5 ;
            sh:maxLength 5 ;
            sh:message "The TAX segment at item level is incorrect." ;
            sh:path edifact-o:hasVATrate ],
        [ sh:maxCount 5 ;
            sh:maxLength 5 ;
            sh:message "The TAX segment at totals level is incorrect." ;
            sh:path edifact-o:hasVATrate ] ;
    sh:targetClass edifact-o:InvoiceDetails,
        edifact-o:Item .

