example_section.text:
## Natural Language Description:
When defining a Qualification Criterion, data curators can specify where the criterion's details are formally documented using up to three optional boolean flags. These flags indicate whether the criterion is stated in the ESPD Request, the Notice, or the Procurement Documents. Additionally, a national sub-criterion may be linked via a direct IRI reference to another Qualification Criterion.

## Prefixes:
