@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .


## Ontology Terms:
URI: http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#QualificationCriterion
Type: Class
Label: Qualification Criterion

URI: http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasQualificationCriteriaStatedInESPDRequest
Type: DatatypeProperty
Label: has Qualification Criteria Stated In ESPD Request

URI: http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasQualificationCriteriaStatedInNotice
Type: DatatypeProperty
Label: has Qualification Criteria Stated In Notice

URI: http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasQualificationCriteriaStatedInProcurementDocuments
Type: DatatypeProperty
Label: has Qualification Criteria Stated In Procurement Documents

URI: http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#includesNationalCriterion
Type: ObjectProperty, AsymmetricProperty
Label: includes National Criterion


## Expected Output:
